OMNeT++ Experiment 24
Title: Mobile IP and Mobility Signalling

Description:
Models a mobile node moving between foreign networks and records registration/update signalling and packet delivery.

Project source files:
- Experiment_24.ned  (NED network and simple module)
- Experiment_24.cc   (C++ simulation module)
- omnetpp.ini           (simulation configuration)

Run in an installed OMNeT++ project:
  opp_makemake
  make
  ./Experiment24Network -u Cmdenv -f omnetpp.ini

NOTE: Graph and console images in this folder are prepared demonstration artifacts.
Run this project in OMNeT++ to obtain environment-specific simulation logs and vectors.
